<title>USA: US Mint buys 250,000 kgs nickel at avg $8.1260/kg.</title>
<headline>US Mint buys 250,000 kgs nickel at avg $8.1260/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Wednesday it bought 250,000 kgs of nickel from two firms at an average price of $8.1260 per kg.</p>
<p>It bought 192,000 kgs of nickel from Hochschild Partners for $8.1251 per kg, and 58,000 kg from Phoenixx International Resources at $8.1291 per kg.</p>
